  "notes": "RSS reader 'Oksskolten'. Distinctive: serif wordmark against an otherwise all-sans UI; light grey sidebar (#f0f0f2) with colored letter-square favicons for each feed; pale blue rounded count pills; article rows are borderless with hairline dividers and 64px rounded square thumbnails (generated gradient-bokeh placeholders or a letter tile when no image). In the capture all article titles render in muted grey (#6b7280) with no unread dot; the live page shows bold black titles with blue unread dots for unread items. Pixel-art pink mascot with 'You're all caught up!' at list end. Search opens a ⌘⇧K centered overlay with filter chips (Read Later/Liked/Unread/Today/Week/Month); 'Get Started' opens a modal to add Feed/Clip/Folder. A hidden 'Notifications alt+T' toast region exists. Live page content differed from the capture (only 2 unread items)."
